From c33180950c3ba8e8ad85f4aa409e3c40db08e907 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SuperVM <supervm@localhost>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:43:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat(castore/fs): serve DAX mappings

Implement setupmapping and removemapping by materializing an inode's blob and
passing its descriptor to the VMM. Without a cache mappings return ENOSYS;
writable mappings return EROFS because castore contents are immutable.

Change-Id: I598099d1c1b62e06296eed7a6fec166062ea3183
---
 snix/castore/src/fs/mod.rs | 95 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 95 insertions(+)

